  "source": "Source: Billboard charts, via Soompi",
  "caption": "LNGSHOT have entered the Billboard 200 for the first time.\n\nTheir EP 'S.W.I.S.H.', released Nov 10 with title track 'Bananas', debuted at No. 118 on the Billboard 200 for the week ending Nov 28. It also ranked No. 3 on World Albums and No. 7 on Top Album Sales. 'S.W.I.S.H.' is their first release since debuting in January with 'SHOT CALLERS'.\n\n📌 Source: Billboard charts (via Soompi, TenAsia)\n#LNGSHOT #롱샷 #SWISH #Bananas #MOREVISION #Billboard200 #kpop #kpopnews",
